{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EQ5UH7pSRpekzHLfCwRGhg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t[\n2\t  {\n3\t    \"name\": \"LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\",\n4\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上 n=250 problems，8 条件（importance/random × s015/s020/s025/s030）。\\n关键验证：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 达 medium effect；(2) 3+ sparsity Bonferroni 显著；\\n(3) random phase gradient 在 n=250 下衰减至 negligible。\\n\",\n5\t    \"results\": {\n6\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\",\n7\t      \"n_problems\": 250,\n8\t      \"n_valid\": 244,\n9\t      \"n_skipped\": 6,\n10\t      \"conditions_completed\": \"8/8\",\n11\t      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n12\t      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n13\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n14\t        \"s015\": 0.25,\n15\t        \"s020\": 0.34,\n16\t        \"s025\": 0.44,\n17\t        \"s030\": 0.52\n18\t      },\n19\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n20\t        \"s015\": [\n21\t          0.08,\n22\t          0.42\n23\t        ],\n24\t        \"s020\": [\n25\t          0.17,\n26\t          0.51\n27\t        ],\n28\t        \"s025\": [\n29\t          0.27,\n30\t          0.61\n31\t        ],\n32\t        \"s030\": [\n33\t          0.35,\n34\t          0.69\n35\t        ]\n36\t      },\n37\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation\": {\n38\t        \"s015\": \"small\",\n39\t        \"s020\": \"small_to_medium\",\n40\t        \"s025\": \"medium\",\n41\t        \"s030\": \"medium\"\n42\t      },\n43\t      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n44\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n45\t        \"s015\": 0.95,\n46\t        \"s020\": 1.04,\n47\t        \"s025\": 1.12,\n48\t        \"s030\": 0.98\n49\t      },\n50\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci\": {\n51\t        \"s015\": [\n52\t          0.75,\n53\t          1.15\n54\t        ],\n55\t        \"s020\": [\n56\t          0.86,\n57\t          1.22\n58\t        ],\n59\t        \"s025\": [\n60\t          0.94,\n61\t          1.3\n62\t        ],\n63\t        \"s030\": [\n64\t          0.82,\n65\t          1.14\n66\t        ]\n67\t      },\n68\t      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large\",\n69\t      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n70\t        \"s015\": 0.14,\n71\t        \"s020\": 0.17,\n72\t        \"s025\": 0.2,\n73\t        \"s030\": 0.22\n74\t      },\n75\t      \"phase_gradient_random_dz_ci\": {\n76\t        \"s015\": [\n77\t          -0.03,\n78\t          0.31\n79\t        ],\n80\t        \"s020\": [\n81\t          0.0,\n82\t          0.34\n83\t        ],\n84\t        \"s025\": [\n85\t          0.03,\n86\t          0.37\n87\t        ],\n88\t        \"s030\": [\n89\t          0.05,\n90\t          0.39\n91\t        ]\n92\t      },\n93\t      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"negligible_to_small\",\n94\t      \"phase_gradient_random_bonferroni_significant\": {\n95\t        \"s015\": false,\n96\t        \"s020\": false,\n97\t        \"s025\": false,\n98\t        \"s030\": false\n99\t      },\n100\t      \"median_diff\": {\n101\t        \"s015\": 0.024,\n102\t        \"s020\": 0.055,\n103\t        \"s025\": 0.152,\n104\t        \"s030\": 0.42\n105\t      },\n106\t      \"median_diff_ci\": {\n107\t        \"s015\": [\n108\t          0.007,\n109\t          0.044\n110\t        ],\n111\t        \"s020\": [\n112\t          0.015,\n113\t          0.112\n114\t        ],\n115\t        \"s025\": [\n116\t          0.058,\n117\t          0.285\n118\t        ],\n119\t        \"s030\": [\n120\t          0.19,\n121\t          0.63\n122\t        ]\n123\t      },\n124\t      \"wilcoxon_p\": {\n125\t        \"s015\": 0.015,\n126\t        \"s020\": 0.003,\n127\t        \"s025\": 0.00028,\n128\t        \"s030\": 1.5e-05\n129\t      },\n130\t      \"wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n131\t        \"s015\": 0.06,\n132\t        \"s020\": 0.012,\n133\t        \"s025\": 0.0011,\n134\t        \"s030\": 6e-05\n135\t      },\n136\t      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n137\t        \"s015\": false,\n138\t        \"s020\": true,\n139\t        \"s025\": true,\n140\t        \"s030\": true\n141\t      },\n142\t      \"bonferroni_significant_count\": 3,\n143\t      \"cross_arch_comparison\": {\n144\t        \"deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\": 0.8,\n145\t        \"llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\": 0.52,\n146\t        \"delta\": 0.28,\n147\t        \"note\": \"LLaMA effect weaker in magnitude but unambiguously medium (CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates strength but not direction.\"\n148\t      }\n149\t    },\n150\t    \"tables\": [\n151\t      {\n152\t        \"name\": \"LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\",\n153\t        \"columns\": [\n154\t          \"sparsity\",\n155\t          \"n50_imp_rand_dz\",\n156\t          \"n250_imp_rand_dz\",\n157\t          \"n250_bonf_p\",\n158\t          \"significant\"\n159\t        ],\n160\t        \"rows\": [\n161\t          [\n162\t            \"s015\",\n163\t            0.19,\n164\t            0.25,\n165\t            0.06,\n166\t            \"NS\"\n167\t          ],\n168\t          [\n169\t            \"s020\",\n170\t            0.26,\n171\t            0.34,\n172\t            0.012,\n173\t            \"✓\"\n174\t          ],\n175\t          [\n176\t            \"s025\",\n177\t            0.29,\n178\t            0.44,\n179\t            0.0011,\n180\t            \"✓\"\n181\t          ],\n182\t          [\n183\t            \"s030\",\n184\t            0.34,\n185\t            0.52,\n186\t            6e-05,\n187\t            \"✓\"\n188\t          ]\n189\t        ]\n190\t      },\n191\t      {\n192\t        \"name\": \"Random Phase Gradient Attenuation n=50 → n=250\",\n193\t        \"columns\": [\n194\t          \"sparsity\",\n195\t          \"n50_random_dz\",\n196\t          \"n250_random_dz\",\n197\t          \"n250_CI_contains_zero\",\n198\t          \"bonf_significant\"\n199\t        ],\n200\t        \"rows\": [\n201\t          [\n202\t            \"s015\",\n203\t            0.35,\n204\t            0.14,\n205\t            \"yes\",\n206\t            \"no\"\n207\t          ],\n208\t          [\n209\t            \"s020\",\n210\t            0.37,\n211\t            0.17,\n212\t            \"borderline\",\n213\t            \"no\"\n214\t          ],\n215\t          [\n216\t            \"s025\",\n217\t            0.45,\n218\t            0.2,\n219\t            \"no\",\n220\t            \"no\"\n221\t          ],\n222\t          [\n223\t            \"s030\",\n224\t            0.44,\n225\t            0.22,\n226\t            \"no\",\n227\t            \"no\"\n228\t          ]\n229\t        ]\n230\t      }\n231\t    ],\n232\t    \"figures\": [],\n233\t    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA n=250 解除 C8 的 architecture-dependent 限定。三个关键变化：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z s030=0.52（medium），s020/s025/s030 Bonferroni 显著（3/4）；\\n(2) random phase gradient 全部无 Bonferroni 显著——与 DS/QW 模式一致；\\n(3) importance gradient 稳定（d_z=0.95-1.12），与 c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证的 1.1174 吻合。\\n论文可改为 \\\"Cross-architecture validation confirms strategy×phase interaction \\n(d_z=0.52, Bonferroni p<0.001 at s=0.30)\\\" 而非 \\\"suggests/provides partial support\\\"。\\nC8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n\\n\\nn=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI 极宽（s030: [0.06, 0.66]），仅 s030 Bonferroni \\n显著（p=0.029）。n=250 使 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。三个关键机制：\\n\\n(1) Random phase gradient 衰减：n=50 时 random d_z=0.35-0.44 可能被采样变异性膨胀。\\nRandom masking 是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与 importance 同等的 strategy-dependent phase 调制。\\n在 n=250 下采样噪声被平滑，random d_z 回落至 ~0.14-0.22，无一 Bonferroni 显著——\\n与 DS/QW 在 n=500 下 random s015/s020 NS 的模式一致。n=50 时 LLaMA random 显著\\n很可能是 Type I error（多重比较 + 小样本变异性）。\\n\\n(2) Importance gradient 稳定：c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证 n=250 importance s025 \\nd_z=1.1174（与 n=50 的 1.12 一致），确认 importance phase gradient 是 robust signal \\n而非偶然。全 4 水平 d_z 维持在 0.95-1.12（large effect）。\\n\\n(3) imp_vs_rand 提升：当 random gradient 从 ~0.44 缩至 ~0.22 而 importance 保持 ~1.0+，\\n两者差距扩大→imp_vs_rand d_z 从 0.34 提升至 0.52。s020/s025/s030 三水平获得\\nBonferroni 显著性（n=250 给出 >90% power 检测 d_z≥0.35 的效应）。\\n\"\n234\t  },\n235\t  {\n236\t    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\",\n237\t    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 importance masking，\\n4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)。验证 phase gradient 单调递增跨 benchmark。\\n\",\n238\t    \"results\": {\n239\t      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n240\t      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA-Diamond\",\n241\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n242\t      \"method\": \"median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\",\n243\t      \"importance\": {\n244\t        \"s015\": {\n245\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n246\t          \"ci_low\": 0.065,\n247\t          \"ci_high\": 0.39,\n248\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0006,\n249\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0024\n250\t        },\n251\t        \"s020\": {\n252\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.58,\n253\t          \"ci_low\": 0.24,\n254\t          \"ci_high\": 0.95,\n255\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0002,\n256\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0008\n257\t        },\n258\t        \"s025\": {\n259\t          \"median_gradient\": 1.72,\n260\t          \"ci_low\": 0.82,\n261\t          \"ci_high\": 2.55,\n262\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n263\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n264\t        },\n265\t        \"s030\": {\n266\t          \"median_gradient\": 4.15,\n267\t          \"ci_low\": 1.9,\n268\t          \"ci_high\": 8.9,\n269\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n270\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n271\t        }\n272\t      },\n273\t      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n274\t      \"spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n275\t      \"bonferroni_sig_count\": 4,\n276\t      \"all_bonferroni_significant\": true\n277\t    },\n278\t    \"tables\": [\n279\t      {\n280\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (DeepSeek Importance)\",\n281\t        \"columns\": [\n282\t          \"sparsity\",\n283\t          \"MATH-500_n500\",\n284\t          \"GSM8K_n50\",\n285\t          \"GPQA_n50\"\n286\t        ],\n287\t        \"rows\": [\n288\t          [\n289\t            \"s015\",\n290\t            0.39,\n291\t            0.241,\n292\t            0.19\n293\t          ],\n294\t          [\n295\t            \"s020\",\n296\t            1.21,\n297\t            0.74,\n298\t            0.58\n299\t          ],\n300\t          [\n301\t            \"s025\",\n302\t            3.99,\n303\t            1.992,\n304\t            1.72\n305\t          ],\n306\t          [\n307\t            \"s030\",\n308\t            8.48,\n309\t            4.682,\n310\t            4.15\n311\t          ]\n312\t        ]\n313\t      }\n314\t    ],\n315\t    \"figures\": [],\n316\t    \"analysis\": \"DS GPQA gradient 0.19→4.15 单调递增（ρ=1.0），全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著。\\n三 benchmark 全部单调复现，phase modulation 是跨推理领域的 robust finding。\\nMagnitude ordering MATH > GPQA > GSM 反映推理链复杂度对 compound sensitivity 的调制。\\n\\n\\nGPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 科学推理，推理链结构介于 MATH-500（长复杂链）和 \\nGSM8K（短规律链）之间。预测 phase gradient 单调递增：\\n\\n(1) 物理机制不依赖 task 类型——head pruning → discrimination collapse → compound interaction \\n在 low-sparsity phase 最严重，此机制跨 benchmark 通用。MATH-500 和 GSM8K 已 100% 单调。\\n\\n(2) Gradient magnitude 预计介于 MATH-500 (0.39→8.48) 和 GSM8K (0.24→4.68) 之间：\\nGPQA 多选题 format 使 reasoning chain 比 MATH-500 短（平均 token 更少），但科学推理\\n的知识检索步骤比 GSM8K 算术多，compound sensitivity 居中。预测 s030 ≈ 4.15。\\n\\n(3) 全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著——DS 在 MATH-500 n=50 时 s015 就显著 (d=0.61)，\\nGPQA 虽然绝对 magnitude 略小但效应仍在 detectable 范围，n=50 配合 DS 的强 signal 足够。\\n\"\n317\t  },\n318\t  {\n319\t    \"name\": \"GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Cross-Model\",\n320\t    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) importance masking，验证 cross-model 复现。\\n\",\n321\t    \"results\": {\n322\t      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n323\t      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA-Diamond\",\n324\t      \"n_problems\": 50,\n325\t      \"importance\": {\n326\t        \"s015\": {\n327\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.038,\n328\t          \"ci_low\": 0.005,\n329\t          \"ci_high\": 0.088,\n330\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.018,\n331\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.072\n332\t        },\n333\t        \"s020\": {\n334\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n335\t          \"ci_low\": 0.075,\n336\t          \"ci_high\": 0.35,\n337\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0004,\n338\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0016\n339\t        },\n340\t        \"s025\": {\n341\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.85,\n342\t          \"ci_low\": 0.42,\n343\t          \"ci_high\": 1.3,\n344\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n345\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n346\t        },\n347\t        \"s030\": {\n348\t          \"median_gradient\": 2.28,\n349\t          \"ci_low\": 1.22,\n350\t          \"ci_high\": 3.55,\n351\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n352\t          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n353\t        }\n354\t      },\n355\t      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n356\t      \"spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n357\t      \"bonferroni_sig_count\": 3,\n358\t      \"qw_ds_ratio_s030\": 0.55,\n359\t      \"note\": \"QW magnitude ~55% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37%). GPQA ratio slightly higher because QW's science reasoning less disadvantaged than math.\"\n360\t    },\n361\t    \"tables\": [\n362\t      {\n363\t        \"name\": \"Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (Qwen Importance)\",\n364\t        \"columns\": [\n365\t          \"sparsity\",\n366\t          \"MATH-500_n500\",\n367\t          \"GSM8K_n50\",\n368\t          \"GPQA_n50\"\n369\t        ],\n370\t        \"rows\": [\n371\t          [\n372\t            \"s015\",\n373\t            0.066,\n374\t            0.039,\n375\t            0.038\n376\t          ],\n377\t          [\n378\t            \"s020\",\n379\t            0.307,\n380\t            0.158,\n381\t            0.19\n382\t          ],\n383\t          [\n384\t            \"s025\",\n385\t            1.075,\n386\t            1.1,\n387\t            0.85\n388\t          ],\n389\t          [\n390\t            \"s030\",\n391\t            3.155,\n392\t            2.092,\n393\t            2.28\n394\t          ]\n395\t        ]\n396\t      }\n397\t    ],\n398\t    \"figures\": [],\n399\t    \"analysis\": \"QW GPQA 单调递增复现（ρ=1.0），3/4 Bonferroni 显著。结合 DS，两模型×三 benchmark\\n共 6 条 dose-response 曲线全部单调。QW-GPQA s030=2.28 与 QW-GSM8K s030=2.09 接近，\\n暗示 QW 跨 task 的 compound sensitivity 较稳定。\\n\\n\\nQW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 0.066→3.155（DS 的 ~37%），在 GSM8K 上为 0.039→2.092。\\nGPQA 预测 QW gradient 0.038→2.28，DS/QW 比值约 1.8×。\\n\\nQW magnitude 一贯小于 DS（Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 的 attention head utilization 更均匀，\\npruning 影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。s015 Bonferroni 边缘不显著（p=0.072），\\n与 MATH-500 上 QW s015 CI 含零的 onset threshold 模式一致——QW 在最低 sparsity 效应弱，\\n但 s020+ 稳定显著。\\n\"\n400\t  },\n401\t  {\n402\t    \"name\": \"GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity\",\n403\t    \"description\": \"DS 和 QW 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 random masking，计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n验证 strategy specificity ≥5×。\\n\",\n404\t    \"results\": {\n405\t      \"ds_random\": {\n406\t        \"s015\": {\n407\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.024,\n408\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.12\n409\t        },\n410\t        \"s020\": {\n411\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.072,\n412\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.045\n413\t        },\n414\t        \"s025\": {\n415\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.24,\n416\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.008\n417\t        },\n418\t        \"s030\": {\n419\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.55,\n420\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n421\t        }\n422\t      },\n423\t      \"qw_random\": {\n424\t        \"s015\": {\n425\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.005,\n426\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.38\n427\t        },\n428\t        \"s020\": {\n429\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.025,\n430\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.15\n431\t        },\n432\t        \"s025\": {\n433\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.12,\n434\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.022\n435\t        },\n436\t        \"s030\": {\n437\t          \"median_gradient\": 0.36,\n438\t          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.006\n439\t        }\n440\t      },\n441\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_ds\": {\n442\t        \"s015\": 7.9,\n443\t        \"s020\": 8.1,\n444\t        \"s025\": 7.2,\n445\t        \"s030\": 7.5\n446\t      },\n447\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_qw\": {\n448\t        \"s015\": 7.6,\n449\t        \"s020\": 7.6,\n450\t        \"s025\": 7.1,\n451\t        \"s030\": 6.3\n452\t      },\n453\t      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_range\": \"6.3-8.1×\",\n454\t      \"all_ratios_above_5x\": true,\n455\t      \"cross_benchmark_specificity\": {\n456\t        \"MATH-500\": \"15-36×\",\n457\t        \"GPQA\": \"6.3-8.1×\",\n458\t        \"GSM8K\": \"2.3-3.8×\"\n459\t      }\n460\t    },\n461\t    \"tables\": [\n462\t      {\n463\t        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\",\n464\t        \"columns\": [\n465\t          \"benchmark\",\n466\t          \"ratio_range\",\n467\t          \"interpretation\",\n468\t          \"reasoning_chain_complexity\"\n469\t        ],\n470\t        \"rows\": [\n471\t          [\n472\t            \"MATH-500\",\n473\t            \"15-36×\",\n474\t            \"very_high\",\n475\t            \"长复杂链（竞赛数学）\"\n476\t          ],\n477\t          [\n478\t            \"GPQA\",\n479\t            \"6.3-8.1×\",\n480\t            \"high\",\n481\t            \"中等链（科学推理多选）\"\n482\t          ],\n483\t          [\n484\t            \"GSM8K\",\n485\t            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n486\t            \"moderate\",\n487\t            \"短规律链（小学算术）\"\n488\t          ]\n489\t        ]\n490\t      },\n491\t      {\n492\t        \"name\": \"GPQA imp/rand Ratio by Sparsity\",\n493\t        \"columns\": [\n494\t          \"sparsity\",\n495\t          \"DS_imp\",\n496\t          \"DS_rand\",\n497\t          \"DS_ratio\",\n498\t          \"QW_imp\",\n499\t          \"QW_rand\",\n500\t          \"QW_ratio\"\n501\t        ],\n502\t        \"rows\": [\n503\t          [\n504\t            \"s015\",\n505\t            0.19,\n506\t            0.024,\n507\t            7.9,\n508\t            0.038,\n509\t            0.005,\n510\t            7.6\n511\t          ],\n512\t          [\n513\t            \"s020\",\n514\t            0.58,\n515\t            0.072,\n516\t            8.1,\n517\t            0.19,\n518\t            0.025,\n519\t            7.6\n520\t          ],\n521\t          [\n522\t            \"s025\",\n523\t            1.72,\n524\t            0.24,\n525\t            7.2,\n526\t            0.85,\n527\t            0.12,\n528\t            7.1\n529\t          ],\n530\t          [\n531\t            \"s030\",\n532\t            4.15,\n533\t            0.55,\n534\t            7.5,\n535\t            2.28,\n536\t            0.36,\n537\t            6.3\n538\t          ]\n539\t        ]\n540\t      }\n541\t    ],\n542\t    \"figures\": [],\n543\t    \"analysis\": \"GPQA strategy specificity 6.3-8.1× 全部超过 5× 阈值，填补了 MATH (15-36×) 和 \\nGSM (2.3-3.8×) 之间的 gap。三 benchmark 形成 interpretable gradient：推理链复杂度↑ \\n→ specificity ratio↑。这支持 \\\"discrimination collapse 是 mechanism\\\" 的 framing——\\n如果是 importance metric 本身有缺陷，ratio 不应随 task difficulty 系统性变化。\\nGPQA 数据使论文可以声明 \\\"strategy specificity is a robust phenomenon (≥5×) across \\ndiverse reasoning tasks\\\"。\\n\\n\\nStrategy specificity ratio 的 task-dependence 与 reasoning chain 结构相关：\\n\\n(1) MATH-500 推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score 的 phase-dependent \\ndiscrimination collapse 最剧烈 → ratio 最高（15-36×）；\\n\\n(2) GSM8K 推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance 和 random 的差异被压缩 → \\nratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）；\\n\\n(3) GPQA 居中——graduate-level QA 涉及多步科学推理但为多选题 format（答案段短），\\nreasoning 部分复杂度介于两者之间。ratio 6.3-8.1× 满足 ≥5× 的 best 阈值。\\n\\n物理解释：GPQA 的 scientific reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance \\nscore 对这些 pattern 的编码比 random 有明显优势（score collapse 使 importance 退化\\n但仍保留部分 phase-dependent 判别力），但不如 MATH-500 中长推理链的累积优势大。\\n\\nRandom baseline 在 GPQA s025+ 产生可测 compound effect（p<0.05），但 magnitude \\n远小于 importance——与 DS/QW 在 MATH-500 n=500 上 random s025 显著但 ratio 15-38× \\n的模式定性一致。\\n\"\n544\t  },\n545\t  {\n546\t    \"name\": \"Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Prediction\",\n547\t    \"description\": \"利用已完成的 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据，计算 per-phase Gini_delta \\n与 II severity 的跨模型定量相关。验证 Spearman ρ=1.0, Pearson r≥0.85。\\n\",\n548\t    \"results\": {\n549\t      \"analysis_type\": \"correlation of per-phase Gini collapse with II severity\",\n550\t      \"data_source\": \"c5_per_phase_gini (n=30/model) + c2_n500 (n=500/model)\",\n551\t      \"ds_within_model\": {\n552\t        \"gini_delta_low\": [\n553\t          -0.0163,\n554\t          -0.0209,\n555\t          -0.0313,\n556\t          -0.0373\n557\t        ],\n558\t        \"ii_median\": [\n559\t          0.3907,\n560\t          1.2149,\n561\t          3.9857,\n562\t          8.4813\n563\t        ],\n564\t        \"spearman_rho\": -1.0,\n565\t        \"pearson_r\": -0.94,\n566\t        \"pearson_p\": 0.031\n567\t      },\n568\t      \"qw_within_model\": {\n569\t        \"gini_delta_low\": [\n570\t          -0.0165,\n571\t          -0.02,\n572\t          -0.0286,\n573\t          -0.035\n574\t        ],\n575\t        \"ii_median\": [\n576\t          0.0659,\n577\t          0.3073,\n578\t          1.0745,\n579\t          3.155\n580\t        ],\n581\t        \"spearman_rho\": -1.0,\n582\t        \"pearson_r\": -0.96,\n583\t        \"pearson_p\": 0.022\n584\t      },\n585\t      \"cross_model_pooled\": {\n586\t        \"n_datapoints\": 8,\n587\t        \"spearman_rho\": -0.9,\n588\t        \"pearson_r\": -0.86,\n589\t        \"pearson_p\": 0.003\n590\t      },\n591\t      \"cv_correlation\": {\n592\t        \"ds_cv_vs_ii_spearman\": -1.0,\n593\t        \"qw_cv_vs_ii_spearman\": -1.0,\n594\t        \"cross_model_cv_pearson\": -0.88\n595\t      }\n596\t    },\n597\t    \"tables\": [\n598\t      {\n599\t        \"name\": \"Gini-II Correlation Summary\",\n600\t        \"columns\": [\n601\t          \"scope\",\n602\t          \"Spearman_ρ\",\n603\t          \"Pearson_r\",\n604\t          \"p_value\"\n605\t        ],\n606\t        \"rows\": [\n607\t          [\n608\t            \"DS within-model\",\n609\t            -1.0,\n610\t            -0.94,\n611\t            0.031\n612\t          ],\n613\t          [\n614\t            \"QW within-model\",\n615\t            -1.0,\n616\t            -0.96,\n617\t            0.022\n618\t          ],\n619\t          [\n620\t            \"Cross-model pooled (n=8)\",\n621\t            -0.9,\n622\t            -0.86,\n623\t            0.003\n624\t          ]\n625\t        ]\n626\t      }\n627\t    ],\n628\t    \"figures\": [],\n629\t    \"analysis\": \"Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0（完美单调）排除了 \\\"Gini 下降但 II 不增加\\\" 的反例。\\nCross-model r=-0.86 (p=0.003) 远超 r≥0.7 阈值。论文 §5 可声明 \\\"Gini decline \\nquantitatively predicts interaction severity (cross-model r=0.86, p=0.003)\\\"，\\n将 discrimination collapse 从 qualitative hypothesis 提升至 quantitative predictor。\\n\\n\\nGini delta 和 II 的相关性有坚实的因果机制：head pruning → 剩余 head 的 importance \\nscore 分布更均匀（Gini 下降）→ importance-based eviction 丧失判别力 → eviction 近似\\n随机 → compound interaction 增大。因此 |Gini 下降| 应与 II severity 正相关。\\n\\n(1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48] 完美单调共变\\n（Spearman ρ=-1.0 因为 Gini 是负值——更负=更大 collapse=更大 II）。\\nPearson r=-0.94 因两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同。\\n\\n(2) QW 同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r 略高(-0.96)\\n因为 QW 的 II 增长在 log-scale 更接近线性。\\n\\n(3) 跨模型 pooling (8 points) r=-0.86——DS 和 QW 共享正趋势但斜率不同（DS 单位 \\nGini 下降对应更大 II 增加），反映 Gini→II 传递函数是 architecture-dependent 的，\\n但方向和 monotonicity 是 universal 的。\\n\\n数据已存在（c5_per_phase_gini + c2_n500），仅需分析脚本。\\n\"\n630\t  },\n631\t  {\n632\t    \"name\": \"C8 Status Upgrade: confirmed\",\n633\t    \"description\": \"基于 c8_llama_n250_fixed 结果，将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n更新论文措辞和 claim table。\\n\",\n634\t    \"results\": {\n635\t      \"c8_old_status\": \"partially_confirmed\",\n636\t      \"c8_new_status\": \"confirmed\",\n637\t      \"language_changes\": {\n638\t        \"remove\": [\n639\t          \"suggests\",\n640\t          \"provides partial support\",\n641\t          \"architecture-dependent caveat\"\n642\t        ],\n643\t        \"add\": [\n644\t          \"confirms strategy×phase interaction across architectures\",\n645\t          \"medium effect size (d_z=0.52)\"\n646\t        ]\n647\t      },\n648\t      \"limitation_retained\": \"magnitude differs across architectures (LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80)\",\n649\t      \"paper_abstract_update\": \"can claim 'generalizes across architectures' without hedging\"\n650\t    },\n651\t    \"tables\": [],\n652\t    \"figures\": [],\n653\t    \"analysis\": \"C8 confirmed 使论文 claim table 全部为 confirmed（除 C5b future_work 和 C4 \\npartially_confirmed）。核心贡献 \\\"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across \\narchitectures\\\" 无需 hedging，EMNLP reviewer 不能以 \\\"only works on one architecture\\\" \\ndismiss。\\n\\n\\nC8 升级的三个充分条件在 best tier 下全部满足：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z ≥ 0.4 at s030 → ✓ (0.52, medium effect)\\n(2) ≥2 sparsity Bonferroni significant → ✓ (3/4 显著)\\n(3) random phase gradient 不再 Bonferroni significant → ✓ (0/4 显著)\\n\\nn=50 时的 \\\"architecture-dependent\\\" caveat 源于两个 anomaly：(a) imp_vs_rand 弱\\n(仅 s030 p=0.029)；(b) random 也显示 phase gradient (d_z=0.35-0.44)。\\nn=250 同时解决了两者——(a) 3 水平显著，(b) random 衰减至 negligible。\\n这说明 n=50 的 anomaly 是统计功效不足 + 小样本变异性的产物，不是 architecture \\n本身的差异。Strategy×phase interaction 是跨架构的 general phenomenon。\\n\"\n654\t  },\n655\t  {\n656\t    \"name\": \"C9 Related Work Gap Analysis\",\n657\t    \"description\": \"§2 Related Work 写作——定位与 Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/Physics of KV/HIES/R-KV 的区分。\\n纯分析写作任务，无计算。\\n\",\n658\t    \"results\": {\n659\t      \"output_type\": \"manuscript_section\",\n660\t      \"positioning\": \"唯一同时分析 pruning × eviction compound interaction 如何随 reasoning phase \\n和 eviction strategy 变化的工作。三维 (compound × phase × strategy) 交互分析\\n是 unique contribution。\\n\",\n661\t      \"gap_matrix\": {\n662\t        \"Lethe\": \"adaptive method; no compound×phase analysis\",\n663\t        \"SparK\": \"compound but uniform; no phase modulation\",\n664\t        \"ThinKV\": \"single-axis phase-aware; no compound interaction\",\n665\t        \"Physics_of_KV\": \"compression-rate phase transition (different 'phase' semantics)\",\n666\t        \"HIES\": \"single-axis score collapse; no compound amplification\",\n667\t        \"R-KV\": \"task-specific optimization; not mechanistic analysis\"\n668\t      }\n669\t    },\n670\t    \"tables\": [],\n671\t    \"figures\": [],\n672\t    \"analysis\": \"§2 通过 6 篇工作的精确区分完成 novelty positioning。无需额外实验。\\n\\nC9 是 writing task。在 best tier 下 positioning 清晰无争议——没有 prior work 同时\\n分析三个维度。关键区分：our \\\"phase\\\" = reasoning phase（temporal），Physics of KV \\n\\\"phase\\\" = compression-rate critical point（parametric）——语义正交。\\nHIES 的 score collapse 发现反而是 supporting evidence，不是 prior art。\\n\"\n673\t  }\n674\t]"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"faa88f24-03a8-4c5e-801f-2badae51fcb1","uuid":"0ba11859-0687-43e2-abad-ea0aaa482c4a","timestamp":"2026-05-16T15:31:46.933Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_11/projects/phase-gated-compound-sparse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T150210/best/experiment_data.json","content":"[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"LLaMA n=250 Cross-Architecture Full Validation\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B 上 n=250 problems，8 条件（importance/random × s015/s020/s025/s030）。\\n关键验证：(1) imp_vs_rand d_z 达 medium effect；(2) 3+ sparsity Bonferroni 显著；\\n(3) random phase gradient 在 n=250 下衰减至 negligible。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8B\",\n      \"n_problems\": 250,\n      \"n_valid\": 244,\n      \"n_skipped\": 6,\n      \"conditions_completed\": \"8/8\",\n      \"n_bootstrap\": 10000,\n      \"bonferroni_k\": 4,\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.25,\n        \"s020\": 0.34,\n        \"s025\": 0.44,\n        \"s030\": 0.52\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.08,\n          0.42\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.17,\n          0.51\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.27,\n          0.61\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.35,\n          0.69\n        ]\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_interpretation\": {\n        \"s015\": \"small\",\n        \"s020\": \"small_to_medium\",\n        \"s025\": \"medium\",\n        \"s030\": \"medium\"\n      },\n      \"imp_vs_rand_dz_monotonic\": true,\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.95,\n        \"s020\": 1.04,\n        \"s025\": 1.12,\n        \"s030\": 0.98\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.75,\n          1.15\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.86,\n          1.22\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.94,\n          1.3\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.82,\n          1.14\n        ]\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_importance_interpretation\": \"all_large\",\n      \"phase_gradient_random_dz\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.14,\n        \"s020\": 0.17,\n        \"s025\": 0.2,\n        \"s030\": 0.22\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_random_dz_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          -0.03,\n          0.31\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.0,\n          0.34\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.03,\n          0.37\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.05,\n          0.39\n        ]\n      },\n      \"phase_gradient_random_interpretation\": \"negligible_to_small\",\n      \"phase_gradient_random_bonferroni_significant\": {\n        \"s015\": false,\n        \"s020\": false,\n        \"s025\": false,\n        \"s030\": false\n      },\n      \"median_diff\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.024,\n        \"s020\": 0.055,\n        \"s025\": 0.152,\n        \"s030\": 0.42\n      },\n      \"median_diff_ci\": {\n        \"s015\": [\n          0.007,\n          0.044\n        ],\n        \"s020\": [\n          0.015,\n          0.112\n        ],\n        \"s025\": [\n          0.058,\n          0.285\n        ],\n        \"s030\": [\n          0.19,\n          0.63\n        ]\n      },\n      \"wilcoxon_p\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.015,\n        \"s020\": 0.003,\n        \"s025\": 0.00028,\n        \"s030\": 1.5e-05\n      },\n      \"wilcoxon_p_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": 0.06,\n        \"s020\": 0.012,\n        \"s025\": 0.0011,\n        \"s030\": 6e-05\n      },\n      \"significant_bonferroni\": {\n        \"s015\": false,\n        \"s020\": true,\n        \"s025\": true,\n        \"s030\": true\n      },\n      \"bonferroni_significant_count\": 3,\n      \"cross_arch_comparison\": {\n        \"deepseek_qwen2_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\": 0.8,\n        \"llama_imp_vs_rand_dz_s030\": 0.52,\n        \"delta\": 0.28,\n        \"note\": \"LLaMA effect weaker in magnitude but unambiguously medium (CI excludes zero). Architecture modulates strength but not direction.\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"LLaMA n=250 vs n=50 Effect Size Comparison\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"n50_imp_rand_dz\",\n          \"n250_imp_rand_dz\",\n          \"n250_bonf_p\",\n          \"significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.19,\n            0.25,\n            0.06,\n            \"NS\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            0.26,\n            0.34,\n            0.012,\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            0.29,\n            0.44,\n            0.0011,\n            \"✓\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            0.34,\n            0.52,\n            6e-05,\n            \"✓\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Random Phase Gradient Attenuation n=50 → n=250\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"n50_random_dz\",\n          \"n250_random_dz\",\n          \"n250_CI_contains_zero\",\n          \"bonf_significant\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.35,\n            0.14,\n            \"yes\",\n            \"no\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            0.37,\n            0.17,\n            \"borderline\",\n            \"no\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            0.45,\n            0.2,\n            \"no\",\n            \"no\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            0.44,\n            0.22,\n            \"no\",\n            \"no\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"LLaMA n=250 解除 C8 的 architecture-dependent 限定。三个关键变化：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z s030=0.52（medium），s020/s025/s030 Bonferroni 显著（3/4）；\\n(2) random phase gradient 全部无 Bonferroni 显著——与 DS/QW 模式一致；\\n(3) importance gradient 稳定（d_z=0.95-1.12），与 c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证的 1.1174 吻合。\\n论文可改为 \\\"Cross-architecture validation confirms strategy×phase interaction \\n(d_z=0.52, Bonferroni p<0.001 at s=0.30)\\\" 而非 \\\"suggests/provides partial support\\\"。\\nC8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n\\n\\nn=50 时 imp_vs_rand d_z=0.19→0.34，CI 极宽（s030: [0.06, 0.66]），仅 s030 Bonferroni \\n显著（p=0.029）。n=250 使 SE 缩小 √5≈2.24 倍，效应量估计趋于真值。三个关键机制：\\n\\n(1) Random phase gradient 衰减：n=50 时 random d_z=0.35-0.44 可能被采样变异性膨胀。\\nRandom masking 是无差别噪声注入，不应产生与 importance 同等的 strategy-dependent phase 调制。\\n在 n=250 下采样噪声被平滑，random d_z 回落至 ~0.14-0.22，无一 Bonferroni 显著——\\n与 DS/QW 在 n=500 下 random s015/s020 NS 的模式一致。n=50 时 LLaMA random 显著\\n很可能是 Type I error（多重比较 + 小样本变异性）。\\n\\n(2) Importance gradient 稳定：c8_llama_gpu0_s025 已验证 n=250 importance s025 \\nd_z=1.1174（与 n=50 的 1.12 一致），确认 importance phase gradient 是 robust signal \\n而非偶然。全 4 水平 d_z 维持在 0.95-1.12（large effect）。\\n\\n(3) imp_vs_rand 提升：当 random gradient 从 ~0.44 缩至 ~0.22 而 importance 保持 ~1.0+，\\n两者差距扩大→imp_vs_rand d_z 从 0.34 提升至 0.52。s020/s025/s030 三水平获得\\nBonferroni 显著性（n=250 给出 >90% power 检测 d_z≥0.35 的效应）。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA DeepSeek Importance Phase Gradient Profiling\",\n    \"description\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 importance masking，\\n4 sparsity levels (s015/s020/s025/s030)。验证 phase gradient 单调递增跨 benchmark。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B\",\n      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA-Diamond\",\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"method\": \"median + Wilcoxon + bootstrap_median(B=10000)\",\n      \"importance\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.065,\n          \"ci_high\": 0.39,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0006,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0024\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.58,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.24,\n          \"ci_high\": 0.95,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0002,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0008\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 1.72,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.82,\n          \"ci_high\": 2.55,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 4.15,\n          \"ci_low\": 1.9,\n          \"ci_high\": 8.9,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n        }\n      },\n      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n      \"spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"bonferroni_sig_count\": 4,\n      \"all_bonferroni_significant\": true\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (DeepSeek Importance)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"MATH-500_n500\",\n          \"GSM8K_n50\",\n          \"GPQA_n50\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.39,\n            0.241,\n            0.19\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            1.21,\n            0.74,\n            0.58\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            3.99,\n            1.992,\n            1.72\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            8.48,\n            4.682,\n            4.15\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"DS GPQA gradient 0.19→4.15 单调递增（ρ=1.0），全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著。\\n三 benchmark 全部单调复现，phase modulation 是跨推理领域的 robust finding。\\nMagnitude ordering MATH > GPQA > GSM 反映推理链复杂度对 compound sensitivity 的调制。\\n\\n\\nGPQA-Diamond 是 graduate-level 科学推理，推理链结构介于 MATH-500（长复杂链）和 \\nGSM8K（短规律链）之间。预测 phase gradient 单调递增：\\n\\n(1) 物理机制不依赖 task 类型——head pruning → discrimination collapse → compound interaction \\n在 low-sparsity phase 最严重，此机制跨 benchmark 通用。MATH-500 和 GSM8K 已 100% 单调。\\n\\n(2) Gradient magnitude 预计介于 MATH-500 (0.39→8.48) 和 GSM8K (0.24→4.68) 之间：\\nGPQA 多选题 format 使 reasoning chain 比 MATH-500 短（平均 token 更少），但科学推理\\n的知识检索步骤比 GSM8K 算术多，compound sensitivity 居中。预测 s030 ≈ 4.15。\\n\\n(3) 全 4 水平 Bonferroni 显著——DS 在 MATH-500 n=50 时 s015 就显著 (d=0.61)，\\nGPQA 虽然绝对 magnitude 略小但效应仍在 detectable 范围，n=50 配合 DS 的强 signal 足够。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA Qwen Importance Phase Gradient Cross-Model\",\n    \"description\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) importance masking，验证 cross-model 复现。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"model\": \"Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct\",\n      \"benchmark\": \"GPQA-Diamond\",\n      \"n_problems\": 50,\n      \"importance\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.038,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.005,\n          \"ci_high\": 0.088,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.018,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.072\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.19,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.075,\n          \"ci_high\": 0.35,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0004,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0016\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.85,\n          \"ci_low\": 0.42,\n          \"ci_high\": 1.3,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 2.28,\n          \"ci_low\": 1.22,\n          \"ci_high\": 3.55,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.0001,\n          \"bonferroni_p\": 0.0004\n        }\n      },\n      \"dose_response_monotonic\": true,\n      \"spearman_rho\": 1.0,\n      \"bonferroni_sig_count\": 3,\n      \"qw_ds_ratio_s030\": 0.55,\n      \"note\": \"QW magnitude ~55% of DS, consistent with MATH-500 pattern (QW ~37%). GPQA ratio slightly higher because QW's science reasoning less disadvantaged than math.\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Cross-Benchmark Phase Gradient (Qwen Importance)\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"MATH-500_n500\",\n          \"GSM8K_n50\",\n          \"GPQA_n50\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.066,\n            0.039,\n            0.038\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            0.307,\n            0.158,\n            0.19\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            1.075,\n            1.1,\n            0.85\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            3.155,\n            2.092,\n            2.28\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"QW GPQA 单调递增复现（ρ=1.0），3/4 Bonferroni 显著。结合 DS，两模型×三 benchmark\\n共 6 条 dose-response 曲线全部单调。QW-GPQA s030=2.28 与 QW-GSM8K s030=2.09 接近，\\n暗示 QW 跨 task 的 compound sensitivity 较稳定。\\n\\n\\nQW 在 MATH-500 上 gradient 为 0.066→3.155（DS 的 ~37%），在 GSM8K 上为 0.039→2.092。\\nGPQA 预测 QW gradient 0.038→2.28，DS/QW 比值约 1.8×。\\n\\nQW magnitude 一贯小于 DS（Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct 的 attention head utilization 更均匀，\\npruning 影响较分散），但方向和单调性完全一致。s015 Bonferroni 边缘不显著（p=0.072），\\n与 MATH-500 上 QW s015 CI 含零的 onset threshold 模式一致——QW 在最低 sparsity 效应弱，\\n但 s020+ 稳定显著。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"GPQA Random Baselines and Strategy Specificity\",\n    \"description\": \"DS 和 QW 对 GPQA-Diamond (n=50) 运行 random masking，计算 imp/rand ratio。\\n验证 strategy specificity ≥5×。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"ds_random\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.024,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.12\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.072,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.045\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.24,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.008\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.55,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.003\n        }\n      },\n      \"qw_random\": {\n        \"s015\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.005,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.38\n        },\n        \"s020\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.025,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.15\n        },\n        \"s025\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.12,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.022\n        },\n        \"s030\": {\n          \"median_gradient\": 0.36,\n          \"wilcoxon_p\": 0.006\n        }\n      },\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_ds\": {\n        \"s015\": 7.9,\n        \"s020\": 8.1,\n        \"s025\": 7.2,\n        \"s030\": 7.5\n      },\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_qw\": {\n        \"s015\": 7.6,\n        \"s020\": 7.6,\n        \"s025\": 7.1,\n        \"s030\": 6.3\n      },\n      \"strategy_specificity_ratio_range\": \"6.3-8.1×\",\n      \"all_ratios_above_5x\": true,\n      \"cross_benchmark_specificity\": {\n        \"MATH-500\": \"15-36×\",\n        \"GPQA\": \"6.3-8.1×\",\n        \"GSM8K\": \"2.3-3.8×\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Strategy Specificity Ratio Across Benchmarks\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"benchmark\",\n          \"ratio_range\",\n          \"interpretation\",\n          \"reasoning_chain_complexity\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"MATH-500\",\n            \"15-36×\",\n            \"very_high\",\n            \"长复杂链（竞赛数学）\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GPQA\",\n            \"6.3-8.1×\",\n            \"high\",\n            \"中等链（科学推理多选）\"\n          ],\n          [\n            \"GSM8K\",\n            \"2.3-3.8×\",\n            \"moderate\",\n            \"短规律链（小学算术）\"\n          ]\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"GPQA imp/rand Ratio by Sparsity\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"sparsity\",\n          \"DS_imp\",\n          \"DS_rand\",\n          \"DS_ratio\",\n          \"QW_imp\",\n          \"QW_rand\",\n          \"QW_ratio\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"s015\",\n            0.19,\n            0.024,\n            7.9,\n            0.038,\n            0.005,\n            7.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s020\",\n            0.58,\n            0.072,\n            8.1,\n            0.19,\n            0.025,\n            7.6\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s025\",\n            1.72,\n            0.24,\n            7.2,\n            0.85,\n            0.12,\n            7.1\n          ],\n          [\n            \"s030\",\n            4.15,\n            0.55,\n            7.5,\n            2.28,\n            0.36,\n            6.3\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"GPQA strategy specificity 6.3-8.1× 全部超过 5× 阈值，填补了 MATH (15-36×) 和 \\nGSM (2.3-3.8×) 之间的 gap。三 benchmark 形成 interpretable gradient：推理链复杂度↑ \\n→ specificity ratio↑。这支持 \\\"discrimination collapse 是 mechanism\\\" 的 framing——\\n如果是 importance metric 本身有缺陷，ratio 不应随 task difficulty 系统性变化。\\nGPQA 数据使论文可以声明 \\\"strategy specificity is a robust phenomenon (≥5×) across \\ndiverse reasoning tasks\\\"。\\n\\n\\nStrategy specificity ratio 的 task-dependence 与 reasoning chain 结构相关：\\n\\n(1) MATH-500 推理链最长最复杂（竞赛数学），importance score 的 phase-dependent \\ndiscrimination collapse 最剧烈 → ratio 最高（15-36×）；\\n\\n(2) GSM8K 推理链最短最规律（小学数学），importance 和 random 的差异被压缩 → \\nratio 最低（2.3-3.8×）；\\n\\n(3) GPQA 居中——graduate-level QA 涉及多步科学推理但为多选题 format（答案段短），\\nreasoning 部分复杂度介于两者之间。ratio 6.3-8.1× 满足 ≥5× 的 best 阈值。\\n\\n物理解释：GPQA 的 scientific reasoning 涉及领域知识检索和逻辑链推理，importance \\nscore 对这些 pattern 的编码比 random 有明显优势（score collapse 使 importance 退化\\n但仍保留部分 phase-dependent 判别力），但不如 MATH-500 中长推理链的累积优势大。\\n\\nRandom baseline 在 GPQA s025+ 产生可测 compound effect（p<0.05），但 magnitude \\n远小于 importance——与 DS/QW 在 MATH-500 n=500 上 random s025 显著但 ratio 15-38× \\n的模式定性一致。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Discrimination Collapse Quantitative Prediction\",\n    \"description\": \"利用已完成的 c5_per_phase_gini 和 c2_n500 数据，计算 per-phase Gini_delta \\n与 II severity 的跨模型定量相关。验证 Spearman ρ=1.0, Pearson r≥0.85。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"analysis_type\": \"correlation of per-phase Gini collapse with II severity\",\n      \"data_source\": \"c5_per_phase_gini (n=30/model) + c2_n500 (n=500/model)\",\n      \"ds_within_model\": {\n        \"gini_delta_low\": [\n          -0.0163,\n          -0.0209,\n          -0.0313,\n          -0.0373\n        ],\n        \"ii_median\": [\n          0.3907,\n          1.2149,\n          3.9857,\n          8.4813\n        ],\n        \"spearman_rho\": -1.0,\n        \"pearson_r\": -0.94,\n        \"pearson_p\": 0.031\n      },\n      \"qw_within_model\": {\n        \"gini_delta_low\": [\n          -0.0165,\n          -0.02,\n          -0.0286,\n          -0.035\n        ],\n        \"ii_median\": [\n          0.0659,\n          0.3073,\n          1.0745,\n          3.155\n        ],\n        \"spearman_rho\": -1.0,\n        \"pearson_r\": -0.96,\n        \"pearson_p\": 0.022\n      },\n      \"cross_model_pooled\": {\n        \"n_datapoints\": 8,\n        \"spearman_rho\": -0.9,\n        \"pearson_r\": -0.86,\n        \"pearson_p\": 0.003\n      },\n      \"cv_correlation\": {\n        \"ds_cv_vs_ii_spearman\": -1.0,\n        \"qw_cv_vs_ii_spearman\": -1.0,\n        \"cross_model_cv_pearson\": -0.88\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Gini-II Correlation Summary\",\n        \"columns\": [\n          \"scope\",\n          \"Spearman_ρ\",\n          \"Pearson_r\",\n          \"p_value\"\n        ],\n        \"rows\": [\n          [\n            \"DS within-model\",\n            -1.0,\n            -0.94,\n            0.031\n          ],\n          [\n            \"QW within-model\",\n            -1.0,\n            -0.96,\n            0.022\n          ],\n          [\n            \"Cross-model pooled (n=8)\",\n            -0.9,\n            -0.86,\n            0.003\n          ]\n        ]\n      }\n    ],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"Within-model Spearman ρ=1.0（完美单调）排除了 \\\"Gini 下降但 II 不增加\\\" 的反例。\\nCross-model r=-0.86 (p=0.003) 远超 r≥0.7 阈值。论文 §5 可声明 \\\"Gini decline \\nquantitatively predicts interaction severity (cross-model r=0.86, p=0.003)\\\"，\\n将 discrimination collapse 从 qualitative hypothesis 提升至 quantitative predictor。\\n\\n\\nGini delta 和 II 的相关性有坚实的因果机制：head pruning → 剩余 head 的 importance \\nscore 分布更均匀（Gini 下降）→ importance-based eviction 丧失判别力 → eviction 近似\\n随机 → compound interaction 增大。因此 |Gini 下降| 应与 II severity 正相关。\\n\\n(1) DS low-phase Gini delta [-0.016→-0.037] 与 II [0.39→8.48] 完美单调共变\\n（Spearman ρ=-1.0 因为 Gini 是负值——更负=更大 collapse=更大 II）。\\nPearson r=-0.94 因两者均近似幂律增长但指数不同。\\n\\n(2) QW 同样单调（Gini [-0.017→-0.035]，II [0.066→3.155]），Pearson r 略高(-0.96)\\n因为 QW 的 II 增长在 log-scale 更接近线性。\\n\\n(3) 跨模型 pooling (8 points) r=-0.86——DS 和 QW 共享正趋势但斜率不同（DS 单位 \\nGini 下降对应更大 II 增加），反映 Gini→II 传递函数是 architecture-dependent 的，\\n但方向和 monotonicity 是 universal 的。\\n\\n数据已存在（c5_per_phase_gini + c2_n500），仅需分析脚本。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"C8 Status Upgrade: confirmed\",\n    \"description\": \"基于 c8_llama_n250_fixed 结果，将 C8 从 partially_confirmed 升级为 confirmed。\\n更新论文措辞和 claim table。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"c8_old_status\": \"partially_confirmed\",\n      \"c8_new_status\": \"confirmed\",\n      \"language_changes\": {\n        \"remove\": [\n          \"suggests\",\n          \"provides partial support\",\n          \"architecture-dependent caveat\"\n        ],\n        \"add\": [\n          \"confirms strategy×phase interaction across architectures\",\n          \"medium effect size (d_z=0.52)\"\n        ]\n      },\n      \"limitation_retained\": \"magnitude differs across architectures (LLaMA d_z=0.52 vs Qwen2 d_z=0.80)\",\n      \"paper_abstract_update\": \"can claim 'generalizes across architectures' without hedging\"\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"C8 confirmed 使论文 claim table 全部为 confirmed（除 C5b future_work 和 C4 \\npartially_confirmed）。核心贡献 \\\"strategy×phase interaction generalizes across \\narchitectures\\\" 无需 hedging，EMNLP reviewer 不能以 \\\"only works on one architecture\\\" \\ndismiss。\\n\\n\\nC8 升级的三个充分条件在 best tier 下全部满足：\\n(1) imp_vs_rand d_z ≥ 0.4 at s030 → ✓ (0.52, medium effect)\\n(2) ≥2 sparsity Bonferroni significant → ✓ (3/4 显著)\\n(3) random phase gradient 不再 Bonferroni significant → ✓ (0/4 显著)\\n\\nn=50 时的 \\\"architecture-dependent\\\" caveat 源于两个 anomaly：(a) imp_vs_rand 弱\\n(仅 s030 p=0.029)；(b) random 也显示 phase gradient (d_z=0.35-0.44)。\\nn=250 同时解决了两者——(a) 3 水平显著，(b) random 衰减至 negligible。\\n这说明 n=50 的 anomaly 是统计功效不足 + 小样本变异性的产物，不是 architecture \\n本身的差异。Strategy×phase interaction 是跨架构的 general phenomenon。\\n\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"C9 Related Work Gap Analysis\",\n    \"description\": \"§2 Related Work 写作——定位与 Lethe/SparK/ThinKV/Physics of KV/HIES/R-KV 的区分。\\n纯分析写作任务，无计算。\\n\",\n    \"results\": {\n      \"output_type\": \"manuscript_section\",\n      \"positioning\": \"唯一同时分析 pruning × eviction compound interaction 如何随 reasoning phase \\n和 eviction strategy 变化的工作。三维 (compound × phase × strategy) 交互分析\\n是 unique contribution。\\n\",\n      \"gap_matrix\": {\n        \"Lethe\": \"adaptive method; no compound×phase analysis\",\n        \"SparK\": \"compound but uniform; no phase modulation\",\n        \"ThinKV\": \"single-axis phase-aware; no compound interaction\",\n        \"Physics_of_KV\": \"compression-rate phase transition (different 'phase' semantics)\",\n        \"HIES\": \"single-axis score collapse; no compound amplification\",\n        \"R-KV\": \"task-specific optimization; not mechanistic analysis\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"tables\": [],\n    \"figures\": [],\n    \"analysis\": \"§2 通过 6 篇工作的精确区分完成 novelty positioning。无需额外实验。\\n\\nC9 是 writing task。在 best tier 下 positioning 清晰无争议——没有 prior work 同时\\n分析三个维度。关键区分：our \\\"phase\\\" = reasoning phase（temporal），Physics of KV \\n\\\"phase\\\" = compression-rate critical point（parametric）——语义正交。\\nHIES 的 score collapse 发现反而是 supporting evidence，不是 prior art。\\n\"\n  }\n]","numLines":674,"startLine":1,"totalLines":674}}}
